# editor: curated material library mirror (copied from materials/ by the vite plugin)
editor/public/materials/

# PBR texture source drops (raw 2K sources; ingested into materials/ at 1K)
_textures/
# editor: IBL environment mirror (copied from env/ by the vite plugin)
